+# TLS Certificate Verification Policy
+
+TLS certificate verification is required on all builds, including development builds: an earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification in development builds has been reverted, and verification is now enforced consistently across development and production environments to maintain a uniform security posture and eliminate the risk of an insecure configuration reaching production.
